 CellID->452500030,ExpressionUUID->"a3c8c81e-1234-5678-9abc-de0012345021"],

Cell["TensorNetworkReplaceIndices rewrites the per-vertex \"Index\" annotations but leaves the graph's edge tags untouched. Edge tags still reference the original index labels:", "ExampleText",
 CellID->452500031,ExpressionUUID->"a3c8c81e-1234-5678-9abc-de0012345022"],

